 -- Function: pgrp_perm (L)
     Turns a list of images into a permutation value.

     Entry ‘i’ of ‘l’ is the image of ‘i’.  The value keeps the degree
     ‘length(l)’.  ‘string(p)’ gives ‘pgrp_perm([...])’, which reads
     back as the same value, and ‘tex(p)’ gives the cycles.

