 -- Function: pgrp_eq (P, Q)
     Returns ‘true’ if ‘p’ and ‘q’ are the same permutation, whatever
     their degrees.

     ‘=’ also compares degrees, so (1 2) of degree 2 and (1 2) of degree
     3 are different under ‘=’ and equal under ‘pgrp_eq’.  A shorter
     permutation counts as fixing the extra points.  Either argument may
     be a list of images.

* Menu:

     * Examples: Examples 6.


