1.4 Single permutations
=======================

Composition reads right to left, as in Dummit and Foote §1.3:
‘pgrp_compose(s, t)’ is s∘t, which applies ‘t’ first.  This is the
opposite of the ‘combinatorics’ package's ‘permult’: ‘permult(p, q)’
equals ‘pgrp_compose(q, p)’.

