 -- Function: pgrp_from_cycles (CYCLES)
     Builds a permutation from a list of cycles, read as a product right
     to left.

     Calling forms:

        • ‘pgrp_from_cycles(cycles)’: the degree is the largest point in
          the cycles
        • ‘pgrp_from_cycles(cycles, n)’: degree ‘n’

     The cycles need not be disjoint: ‘pgrp_from_cycles([[1, 2], [1,
     3]])’ is (1 2)∘(1 3).

