1.6 Groups
==========

A group is given by generators.  ‘pgrp_order’ and ‘pgrp_member_p’ use
cl-permutation's Schreier-Sims implementation, so they work on very
large groups.  Functions that list a group's elements refuse groups with
more than ‘pgrp_max_elements’ elements.

