File: permutations.info,  Node: Function pgrp_composition_series G,  Next: Function pgrp_sylow G p,  Prev: Function pgrp_nilpotent_p G,  Up: Series Sylow subgroups and products

 -- Function: pgrp_composition_series (G)
     Returns a composition series G = G_0 > G_1 > ... > 1, each a normal
     subgroup of the one before with a simple quotient.

     Each step takes a largest proper normal subgroup, which lists
     elements, so keep ‘G’ small.

