File: permutations.info,  Node: Function pgrp_abelian_invariants G,  Next: Function pgrp_abelian_groups n,  Prev: Function pgrp_direct_product G H,  Up: Series Sylow subgroups and products

 -- Function: pgrp_abelian_invariants (G)
     Returns the invariant factors [d_1, d_2, ...] of an abelian group
     ‘G’, with each d_i dividing the next.

     ‘G’ is isomorphic to Z_d1 x Z_d2 x ....  The trivial group gives
     ‘[]’.  Fails if ‘G’ isn't abelian.

